{"c":[{"id":"9663e92a97e02b87","sum":"C2 fill lore: build Step.memory refs with memoryRefOf, never by hand; countries come only from closed state/province lists; forms over 20 fields split into parts of <=20, each accepted and undone alone; page-loop-eval retries Fill all after 500 ms.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"cc84b3cf81253ebf","sum":"C2: build Step.memory refs (id[#part][~option|~date]) with memoryRefOf(m, conversionOf(control)), never by hand; placeWithCountry adds a country only from the closed US-state/CA-province lists, for fields asksPlace accepts.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261006T085433Z-15cdbeee47a325f7","text":"C2: Step.memory refs are id[#part][~option|~date]; memoryWrites checks text exactly and only options/dates through their conversion. Build refs with memoryRefOf(m, conversionOf(control)), never by hand.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261006T085433Z-9b6840ae7771fd2d","text":"C2: placeWithCountry adds a country only by the closed US-state/CA-province lists and only for fields asksPlace accepts; the engine still needs exactly one loaded option equal to it. About country is deliberately not used.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"d359c1b9ca63551e","sum":"C2: a page form over 20 fields is one goal with a segment per part of <=20 (reason moreFields), each run and undone on its own goalAccept; page-loop-eval's Fill all can race the page's ready-on-load fill, so it asks again after 500 ms.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261006T085433Z-a637346e142ef258","text":"C2: a page form over 20 fields is one goal with a segment per part of <=20 (page-planner parts, lower.ts cut, reason moreFields); each part runs only on its own goalAccept and undoes as task goal:sN. Fields past 4 parts are named as the user's.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261006T085434Z-d647567d5018f182","text":"C2: page-loop-eval's corpus Fill all can race the page's own ready-on-load fill (helper.fill returns null for a form in flight, no error); the row now asks again after 500 ms and logs it.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f8c7e4d7077b1a19","sum":"F2/GW1 fill and gateway lore: joined ambient fills are promoted to explicit; fill joins keep the caller's identity across waits; gateway.only names the serving provider; Laya is fixture-only (its endpoint permits training).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"bbf67222105d2e73","sum":"F2: fillRequest promotes a joined ambient flight to explicit before publishing, since ambient pop-ups fill no proposals. GW1: providerOptions.gateway.only names the serving provider from the model's endpoints API (laya-free is served by boundless).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261006T092359Z-18f5690369a8fa9a","text":"F2: fillRequest promotes a joined ambient flight to explicit before publication: ambient pop-ups do not populate proposals, so returning their FillProposal alone cannot serve handleFillAll. Different field scopes in one window wait and resolve fields again.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261006T094129Z-8c5d1007dd7df018","text":"GW1: the gateway serves convaiinnovations/laya-free through boundless, not convaiinnovations; providerOptions.gateway.only must use the serving provider listed by the model's endpoints API.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"79e694bb1404294d","sum":"GW1: Laya is fixture-only (its endpoint permits training): harnessEngine fixture provenance only, shipped apps refuse it. Fill joins compare selectedFormInputs after TabSource.readFor and keep the caller's reader/document/trigger identity across waits.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261006T100225Z-f4d02db1f4186bed","text":"GW1: Laya is fixture-only because its boundless endpoint permits training; use harnessEngine fixture provenance even with cache off. Generic clients without fixture provenance refuse it, and shipped-app markers always refuse it. Gateway Jev keeps normal sources.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261006T102153Z-a32a254ad92c6952","text":"Fill joins compare selectedFormInputs after TabSource.readFor: capped formFields can match scopes with different ranked controls. Preserve the caller reader/document/trigger identity across waits.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
